 class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p$\">$p$</span> (in <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T_pM$\">$T_pM$</span>). By <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh05_GeodesicsAndDistance%23prop%3Apet-ch5-segment-domain-open\" data-tex-node=\"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#prop:pet-ch5-segment-domain-open\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a7065742d6368352d7365676d656e742d646f6d61696e2d6f70656e\">subsection 7.3</a> and <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh05_GeodesicsAndDistance%23lem%3Apet-ch5-exp-nonsingular-segment-domain\" data-tex-node=\"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#lem:pet-ch5-exp-nonsingular-segment-domain\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7065742d6368352d6578702d6e6f6e73696e67756c61722d7365676d656e742d646f6d61696e\">subsection 7.3</a>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r(x)=|px|$\">$r(x)=|px|$</span> is smooth on the open dense set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$U_p=\\{ p\\} \\cup \\exp _p(\\operatorname {seg}^0(p))$\">$U_p=\\{ p\\} \\cup \\exp _p(\\operatorname {seg}^0(p))$</span> and fails to be smooth off <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$U_p$\">$U_p$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#rem:pet-ch5-segment-domain-open-blocker","next":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#cor:pet-ch5-cut-locus-smoothness","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#def:pet-ch5-segment-domain","title":"def:pet-ch5-segment-domain","label":"def:pet-ch5-segment-domain"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#cor:pet-ch5-cut-locus-smoothness","title":"cor: